OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud along 
OL,6,Fwith some bright or sunny intervals.   
OL,7,FChance of a few light passing showers  
OL,8,Fotherwise a fair amount of dry         
OL,9,Fweather. Moderate north or             
OL,10,Fnortheasterly wind.                    
OL,12,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening and      
OL,13,Fnight with variable amounts of cloud   
OL,14,Fand some clear periods. Chance of a    
OL,15,Fbrief light shower across Orkney.      
OL,16,FSlight frost in places.                
OL,18,CSunday:FIt will be a dry day with      
OL,19,Fsunny intervals. Moderate occasionally 
OL,20,Ffresh east or northeasterly wind.      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
