OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry   
OL,6,Fand bright on Monday. Strengthening    
OL,7,Fsoutheasterly winds may bring rain for 
OL,8,Fa time later on Tuesday and Wednesday, 
OL,9,Fotherwise dry.                         
